{"id":"2ee99d9cb28cc6d3","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-extinterval.md","title":"Extension interval, lattice, and count","display":"thm-extinterval — Extension interval, lattice, and count","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-extinterval","aliases":["27-thm-extinterval"],"display":"thm-extinterval — Extension interval, lattice, and count","depends_on":["[[27-df-extrema]]","[[27-df-extension]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§12.2.1, after Theorem 12.1","source_printed_pages":"515","source_pdf_pages":"539","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-extinterval"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-extinterval</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-extinterval — Extension interval, lattice, and count"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"002418bdd321687f\" href=\"?note=002418bdd321687f\" title=\"27-df-extrema\">27-df-extrema</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2080bf803b294b75\" href=\"?note=2080bf803b294b75\" title=\"27-df-extension\">27-df-extension</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§12.2.1, after Theorem 12.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"515"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"539"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n\">\\((T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n\\)</span>；极端扩张见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"002418bdd321687f\" href=\"?note=002418bdd321687f\" title=\"27-df-extrema\">27-df-extrema</a>，扩张族见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2080bf803b294b75\" href=\"?note=2080bf803b294b75\" title=\"27-df-extension\">27-df-extension</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\leq h\">\\(g\\leq h\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(g(a)\\leq h(a))\">\\(\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(g(a)\\leq h(a))\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a> 的全函数载体；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ext}(T,F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ext}(T,F)\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2080bf803b294b75\" href=\"?note=2080bf803b294b75\" title=\"27-df-extension\">27-df-extension</a> 在固定元数 n 下的扩张族。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ext}(T,F)=\\{g\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\mid f^-_{T,F}\\leq g\\leq f^+_{T,F}\\},\\qquad |\\mathrm{Ext}(T,F)|=2^{\\,2^n-|T|-|F|}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Ext}(T,F)=\\{g\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\mid f^-_{T,F}\\leq g\\leq f^+_{T,F}\\},\\qquad |\\mathrm{Ext}(T,F)|=2^{\\,2^n-|T|-|F|}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>规定真点强制为 1，规定假点强制为 0，其余 2^n−|T|−|F| 个点独立选择。点序区间对逐点 ∧、∨ 封闭，给出原书所述有限格。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-extrema","status":"resolved","id":"002418bdd321687f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-extrema]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-extension","status":"resolved","id":"2080bf803b294b75","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-extrema","status":"resolved","id":"002418bdd321687f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n$；极端扩张见 [[27-df-extrema]]，扩张族见 [[27-df-extension]]；$g\\leq h$ 表示 $\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(g(a)\\leq h(a))$。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-extension","status":"resolved","id":"2080bf803b294b75","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n$；极端扩张见 [[27-df-extrema]]，扩张族见 [[27-df-extension]]；$g\\leq h$ 表示 $\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(g(a)\\leq h(a))$。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ 是 [[27-df-boolfunc]] 的全函数载体；$\\mathrm{Ext}(T,F)$ 是 [[27-df-extension]] 在固定元数 n 下的扩张族。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-extension","status":"resolved","id":"2080bf803b294b75","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ 是 [[27-df-boolfunc]] 的全函数载体；$\\mathrm{Ext}(T,F)$ 是 [[27-df-extension]] 在固定元数 n 下的扩张族。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n","display":false},{"tex":"g\\leq h","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(g(a)\\leq h(a))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ext}(T,F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ext}(T,F)=\\{g\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\mid f^-_{T,F}\\leq g\\leq f^+_{T,F}\\},\\qquad |\\mathrm{Ext}(T,F)|=2^{\\,2^n-|T|-|F|}.","display":true}],"bytes":1402,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-421","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-extinterval|thm-extinterval — Extension interval, lattice, and count]]"},{"id":"6164dd467b436ea1","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"显式最小函数在 T 取 1，在其他点取 0；它属于扩张族且逐点不大于任何扩张。偏序的反对称性保证唯一，完整区间与计数另见 [[27-thm-extinterval]]。"}],"outgoing":["002418bdd321687f","2080bf803b294b75","5d10aed668d85817"]}